##RenderMan RIB-Structure 1.0
# GitHub #230: an output variable named P is P as the surface shader sees it (camera space, the "current" space), for every
# primitive and hider. A static quad grid, in a 64 x 64 orthographic image over (0,0)-(1,1): pixel (16, 16) is at about (0.258, 0.742, 1).
version 3.03
Hider "reyes"
Option "shaderformat" "default" ["rslo"]
PixelSamples 1 1
PixelFilter "box" 1 1
Quantize "rgba" 0 0 0 0
Display "aov-p-space-quad-reyes-rgba.tif" "file" "rgba"
Display "+aov-p-space-quad-reyes.tif" "file" "P"
Projection "orthographic"
ScreenWindow 0 1 0 1
Format 64 64 1
Clipping 0.1 100
Translate 0 0 1
WorldBegin
  Surface "constant"
  Patch "bilinear" "P" [0 0 0  1 0 0  0 1 0  1 1 0]
WorldEnd
